{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/457", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/457/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/457/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/457/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/457", "id": 343175913, "node_id": "MDU6SXNzdWUzNDMxNzU5MTM=", "number": 457, "title": "attitude_euler_angle() returns \"NaN\" for Pixhawk 2.1 Cube", "user": {"login": "loganriggs", "id": 25249051, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjQ5MDUx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25249051?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs", "html_url": "https://github.com/loganriggs", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2018-07-20T16:44:57Z", "updated_at": "2018-07-21T17:23:57Z", "closed_at": "2018-07-21T17:23:57Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "### Using Raspberry Pi 3 B+\r\n\r\n- If running with the Pixhawk 2.1 cube (with motors, gps, lidar, flow, etc powered) , attitude_euler_angle().yaw_deg returns \"NaN\". (Also returns \"NaN\" for roll, pitch, and quaternion values)\r\n- If running the sitl simulation, attitude_euler_angle().yaw_deg returns the correct attitude\r\n\r\n### Using Linux Ubuntu 16.04.3\r\n- If running with the Pixhawk 2.1 cube (Just connected straight to the Cube, no peripherals are powered), attitude_euler_angle() also returns the correct attitude.\r\n- If running the simulation, attitude_euler_angle() returns the correct attitude.\r\n\r\n### Possible Leads\r\n1. I have a video of receiving the correct attitude from mid-May. The major difference there is the v1.8.0 Firmware update released June 19th. At the time of the video, it was (most likely) running v1.7.3 released Jan. 6th. I was having trouble reverting back to that firmware to check, so I haven't tested that yet.\r\n2. Telemetry().longitude/latitude/velocity also are null on the Pixhawk 2.1 cube if the gps isn't locked (flashing green). This makes sense, so there might be a different hardware component that affects attitude like the gps affects the above values.", "closed_by": {"login": "loganriggs", "id": 25249051, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjQ5MDUx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25249051?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs", "html_url": "https://github.com/loganriggs", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/457/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/457/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/406811126", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/457#issuecomment-406811126", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/457", "id": 406811126, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQwNjgxMTEyNg==", "user": {"login": "loganriggs", "id": 25249051, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjQ5MDUx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25249051?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs", "html_url": "https://github.com/loganriggs", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/loganriggs/received_events", "type": "User", "user_vie